		<!--
			Export-compliance declaration. The app only uses standard,
			exempt encryption (HTTPS/TLS to the backend, Firebase, JWT) —
			no proprietary/custom cryptography — so it does NOT use
			non-exempt encryption. Setting this to false tells App Store
			Connect to stop prompting for export-compliance docs on every
			submission.
		-->
